Package: phpsploit
Version: 3.2-aea961d
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python, python-pip
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nil0x42/phpsploit
Description: Stealth post-exploitation C2 framework for web servers
 PhpSploit is a remote control framework that provides a stealth
 interactive shell-like connection over HTTP between client and
 web server. It uses a polymorphic PHP backdoor, hides traffic in
 HTTP headers, and includes 20+ plugins for privilege escalation,
 file management, SQL console, and reverse TCP shells.
